{"id":9166,"date":"2020-11-24T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2020-11-24T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/using-technology-to-boost-efficiency-profitability-of-your-behavioral-health-practice-webinar\/"},"modified":"2024-10-03T16:20:29","modified_gmt":"2024-10-03T20:20:29","slug":"using-technology-to-boost-efficiency-profitability-of-your-behavioral-health-practice-webinar","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/using-technology-to-boost-efficiency-profitability-of-your-behavioral-health-practice-webinar\/","title":{"rendered":"Using Technology to Boost Efficiency &#038; Profitability of your Behavioral Health Practice"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9166\" class=\"elementor elementor-9166\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-45d8c91a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"45d8c91a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3b2baba0\" data-id=\"3b2baba0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5061dc51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5061dc51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As one of the most important aspects of a business, it is <strong>imperative for business owners to align your technology in order to promote growth in a scalable way.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>An often ignored (yet equally important!) follow up to the initial implementation of this technology is monitoring and reacting based on your operations.<\/p>\n<h2>Topics Discussed<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Discuss best practices in key business and technology areas that are important to align in Behavioral Health in order to be more successful and more profitable<\/li>\n<li>Present case studies of successful business re-alignment<\/li>\n<li>Provide ways to identify if your business is out of alignment and what to do about it<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>About PulseOne<\/h2>\n<p>For nearly 20 years, <a href=\"https:\/\/pulseone.com\/about-us\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PulseOne<\/a> is a business services company delivering operational support to small and mid-sized companies utilizing our team of technology and results-driven experts.<\/p>\n<h2>About the Presenters<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-49544ac authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"49544ac\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-42292d6\" data-id=\"42292d6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05f8d01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"05f8d01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/chad-wiggins-pulseone.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18522\" alt=\"Headshot of Chad Wiggins from PulseOne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/chad-wiggins-pulseone.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/chad-wiggins-pulseone-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/chad-wiggins-pulseone-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8c435b9\" data-id=\"8c435b9\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a2fce2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9a2fce2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Chad Wiggins<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Director of Business Development at PulseOne<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Chad has 25 years\u2019 experience in the IT solutions and technology space. He is a Solutions Architect and enables PulseOne\u2019s clients to maximize business growth with strategic planning, implementing technology plans and ensuring tech resources are aligned with their business goals.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-264afa5 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"264afa5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-275a652\" data-id=\"275a652\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d6efd1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0d6efd1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/paul-freeman-pulseone.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18523\" alt=\"Headshot of Paul Freeman, Managing Partner and the Chief Development Officer at PulseOne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/paul-freeman-pulseone.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/paul-freeman-pulseone-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/11\/paul-freeman-pulseone-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c8e5211\" data-id=\"c8e5211\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-269c63c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"269c63c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Paul Freeman<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Managing Partner and the Chief Development Officer at PulseOne<\/span><\/p>\n<p>A long-time technology industry professional, Paul brings his over 25 years of experience in business and IT operations best practices to support PulseOne&#8217;s business clients. His experience has given him an exceptional view on what it takes to be a successful business and business leader in today&#8217;s technology integrated world.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":14841,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Technology Boost Practice Efficiency, Profitability","_seopress_titles_desc":"Best practice in key business & technology areas that are important to align in Behavioral Health in order to be more successful & more profitable.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[329,69,335],"resource-tag":[339],"class_list":["post-9166","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-business","resource-topic-practice-management","resource-tag-success"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9166","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9166\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia